78
00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.026
We all miss her, you know.

79
00:13:42.932 --> 00:13:45.110
Don't stay too long. Okay?

80
00:15:59.919 --> 00:16:02.808
Oh. Oh, no, no, no, no.

