00:18:23.544 --> 00:18:25.068
Danny.

93
00:18:26.498 --> 00:18:28.034
Danny.

94
00:18:31.002 --> 00:18:32.725
"Kincaid Books.

95
00:18:32.805 --> 00:18:36.240
West 81st Street, New York, New York."

96
00:19:02.359 --> 00:19:03.923
K.

97
00:19:04.803 --> 00:19:06.359
L.

98
00:19:07.239 --> 00:19:08.828
5.

99
00:19:10.308 --> 00:19:11.897
0.

100
00:19:12.377 --> 00:19:13.899
1.

101
00:19:14.279 --> 00:19:15.847
8.

102
